### Reemplazo de dispositivo con datos completos — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/replaceDevice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitIdToReplace": 1,
  "serialNumber": "NEW123XYZ789",
  "osId": 1,
  "osVersion": "14",
  "deviceManufacturer": "Google",
  "deviceModel": "Pixel 7",
  "phoneNumber": "+50212345678"
}

### Reemplazo mínimo (solo campos requeridos) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/replaceDevice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitIdToReplace": 1,
  "serialNumber": "NEW-SN-0002"
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/replaceDevice
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitIdToReplace": 1,
  "serialNumber": "NEW123XYZ789"
}

### unitIdToReplace inválido (0) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/replaceDevice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitIdToReplace": 0,
  "serialNumber": "NEW123XYZ789"
}

### Sin serialNumber (campo requerido faltante) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/replaceDevice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitIdToReplace": 1
}

### Unidad inexistente → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/replaceDevice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitIdToReplace": 999999999,
  "serialNumber": "NEW123XYZ789"
}
